@Gideon Sato, the channel shows your first report at **10:42 AM on 3 Aug** (your message: "gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant… both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan").

On the guard, the channel only has one line. Your 10:42 message says the **guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard** while the kiosks were down. Mateo's 11:03 message says the guard checked in trailer 8836 once kiosk 1 was back, and dispatch could see it. Nothing in the channel describes the guard's activity between those two points.

There is an earlier entry in ticket SUP-5380 (Hartford gate kiosks offline, Sev 1). Its update log says at **08:12** "Rebot failed; drivers queueing. Checking conn. now." The log doesn't say who wrote that entry, so I can't tell whether it was a report from your side. It's worth checking the ticket's author before the postmortem uses 08:12 as the first report.
